//
// Four RPCs are published:
//   Publish    unary             — publish one event, returns assigned offset
//   Subscribe  server-streaming  — stream events; from_offset > 0 replays first,
//                                  then live fan-out (the gRPC server keeps an
//                                  in-process channel per subscriber so the
//                                  broker library stays untouched)
